<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch post Dfl 3.7 billion November trade surplus.</title>
<headline>Dutch post Dfl 3.7 billion November trade surplus.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch trade surplus widened to a provisional 3.7 billion guilders in November 1996 from 3.3 billion in October 1996, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said on Monday.</p>
</text>
